# Agent capture

Prompts and final responses are captured automatically by project hooks in `.cursor/hooks.json` (script: `.cursor/hooks/agent-capture.py`) into `.agent-logs/`.

- Do not add `.agent-logs/` to `.gitignore`.
- Do not edit, tidy, summarise, or delete log entries after the fact.
- Do not manually rewrite captures. The hook is the source of truth.
- Commit `.agent-logs/` interleaved with the code those turns produced.
